# /image on a catalog row tagged tool-use only: fx takes its vision-tool route
# (the model answers text, so the forced call is missing); xfx refuses the
# model before any request.
gateway image-turns.json
work image-ws
wait 3
type /image shot.png
key Enter
wait 1.5
snap attached
type  what is in this image?
key Enter
wait 5
snap sent
snapfull end
gwlog
